# desc: 종속항 전체가 아니라 부가한 사항만 대비한 판단과 그 청구항은? (결손 dependent-added-limitation)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT ?j ?claim
WHERE { ?j a pa:ExaminerJudgment ; pa:judgmentScope pa:ScopeAddedLimitation ; pa:judgesClaim ?claim . }
ORDER BY ?j ?claim
